Spleen bitmap font -- attribution and license
=============================================

The glyph data in spleen-5x8-font-data.nix and spleen-8x16-font-data.nix is
GENERATED (by spleen-bdf-to-nix.awk, run from spleen-font.nix) from the Spleen
bitmap font by Frederic Cambus, as vendored in the upstream source tree:

    spleen-5x8.bdf   (5x8 cell, dense detail rows)
    spleen-8x16.bdf  (8x16 cell, mid-size secondary text)

pinned to the Spleen 2.2.0 release commit
    0493c34e22791824767c618fed42c434b477662c
fetched from
    https://raw.githubusercontent.com/fcambus/spleen/0493c34e22791824767c618fed42c434b477662c/spleen-5x8.bdf
    https://raw.githubusercontent.com/fcambus/spleen/0493c34e22791824767c618fed42c434b477662c/spleen-8x16.bdf
    with sha256:
      spleen-5x8.bdf   sha256-QEiBhNB10MdSzdI5tEHF7OUeULNTFW8klsdWw4SrAcs=
      spleen-8x16.bdf  sha256-Sj2X7mGoyGp1JdjHI8uKFAgfOVzS/rQie6XjuvBim64=

Upstream project: https://github.com/fcambus/spleen -- https://www.cambus.net/

Spleen is released under the BSD 2-Clause license (SPDX: BSD-2-Clause). The
generated *-font-data.nix files are a mechanical re-encoding of that bitmap data
(WxH cell -> one row int per row per glyph) and carry the same terms and
attribution. The full license text follows.

